$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=lswin  LOC_AFTER=?

* Window sieve (LargeSieve window_sieve, steps 2-5): for coefficients on integers coprime to every modulus up to Q, with frequencies within E of M, the sum over q <_ Q of the per-modulus primitive-character blocks weighted f / phi ( q ) is at most ( Q ^ 2 + 4 pi E ) times the mass.

